    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   These guys... are pretty tough!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "These guys... are pretty tough!"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Gaah-! Damn, that shield of yours...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Gaah-! Damn, that shield of yours..."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Sh-she's the one from the L.G.D...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Sh-she's the one from the L.G.D...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   It's not too late to put down your weapons and surrender...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "It's not too late to put down your weapons and surrender..."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   Unless you want to die in vain right here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Unless you want to die in vain right here."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   You'd expect us to believe you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "You'd expect us to believe you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Liar! Ursus... they've said the same thing before. But they executed those Infected, one by one...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Liar! Ursus... they've said the same thing before. But they executed those Infected, one by one..."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   I hid beneath the bodies of the slain, holding my breath, in order to survive.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "I hid beneath the bodies of the slain, holding my breath, in order to survive."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   There are no depths to which your kind won't stoop... in order to exterminate us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "There are no depths to which your kind won't stoop... in order to exterminate us."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Aren't you just trying to round us up so you can kill us faster?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Aren't you just trying to round us up so you can kill us faster?"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Very well. You've made your choice then.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Very well. You've made your choice then."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   You're not getting through to them, big fella. They won't listen to reason.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "You're not getting through to them, big fella. They won't listen to reason."
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   They can't even distinguish between good and even, Lungmen and Ursus.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "They can't even distinguish between good and even, Lungmen and Ursus."
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   In that place... No, in many places...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "In that place... No, in many places..."
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   Only hatred exists between those who are infected and those who are not.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "Only hatred exists between those who are infected and those who are not."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]   It seems that because of that... all communication has broken down. Even though there's another path in front of our eyes.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "It seems that because of that... all communication has broken down. Even though there's another path in front of our eyes."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1500_skulsr\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1500_skulsr.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skullshatterer\"]   Another path?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skullshatterer",
        "content": "Another path?"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skullshatterer\"]   What... could we possibly do?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skullshatterer",
        "content": "What... could we possibly do?"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Skullshatterer\"]   And what could you accomplish?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Skullshatterer",
        "content": "And what could you accomplish?"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1002_nsabr_2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Reunion Member\"]   Don't waste any more time listening to their lies! Skullshatterer, let's get rid of them together!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Reunion Member",
        "content": "Don't waste any more time listening to their lies! Skullshatterer, let's get rid of them together!"
